{
  "contract_version": 2,
  "description": "Contract-v2 cross-platform protocol for the E0 artifact. A-class fields are exact, B-class numeric fields are tolerance-compared only on trials the reference-side identifiability rule marks identifiable, C-class diagnostics are compared by semantics, and D-class decisions use declared boundaries. Tolerances are a measured draft, not frozen.",
